OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry. Then the rest of the
OL,7,Fnight will be dry with cloud clearing
OL,8,Fto allow some lengthy clear periods.
OL,9,FChilly in some rural glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA cloudy start in parts of the
OL,12,Feast, otherwise it will be dry day
OL,13,Fwith some warm sunshine.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FMainly
OL,16,Fdry on Tuesday. Likely to become more
OL,17,Funsettled on Wednesday and Thursday
OL,18,Fwith spells of rain extending north.
